## 2. Verification Performed

**Registration:**
```
POST /auth/register → 201, returns new user (no password in response)
```

**Login:**
```
POST /auth/login → 200, returns access_token + token_type
```

**Protected route (any logged-in user):**
```
GET /auth/me (with token) → 200, returns own profile
```

**Role enforcement:**
```
python make_admin.py test2@example.com → user promoted to admin
GET /auth/admin-only (as regular user) → 403 Forbidden
GET /auth/admin-only (as promoted admin, new token) → 200, "Role check passed"
```

